    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302110/extras/29726dcf120dc42a47bba3ed96a4c778.poster.avif?t=1741268368\" width=616 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302110/extras/29726dcf120dc42a47bba3ed96a4c778.webm?t=1741268368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302110/extras/29726dcf120dc42a47bba3ed96a4c778.mp4?t=1741268368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur's Quest is a JRPG with dating sim elements and skills based on wearing clothes provided by 2 Bara Spirits. You can date and unlock scenes with them by leveling up the skills linked to their clothes. The story is about a prince who goes undercover in a new kingdom to save his people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302110/extras/53eab2e36f1939f554dd8d8f7f7284a5.webp?t=1741268368\" width=616 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302110/extras/5d66978d555b0fcf9be7ad45a362c184.webp?t=1741268368\" width=17 height=18 /></span>Clothing System with 4 outfits and unique skills to learn for each one (including a nude one);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302110/extras/5d66978d555b0fcf9be7ad45a362c184.webp?t=1741268368\" width=17 height=18 /></span>\u00a010 H-Scenes including kissing ones;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302110/extras/5d66978d555b0fcf9be7ad45a362c184.webp?t=1741268368\" width=17 height=18 /></span>Explore a Fantasy World;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302110/extras/5d66978d555b0fcf9be7ad45a362c184.webp?t=1741268368\" width=17 height=18 /></span>Bara characters;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302110/extras/5d66978d555b0fcf9be7ad45a362c184.webp?t=1741268368\" width=17 height=18 /></span>A Classic JRPG combat with turned-based battle;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302110/extras/ee9179245f57721fb018a9ed85c2fb1a.webp?t=1741268368\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p>",
